    {
      "_id": "whbEmWolfChase01",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
      "name": "狼途追猎",
      "sort": 500000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "action"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": 1
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每轮 1 次；<strong>需求</strong> 目标是猎物印记，或处于惊惧 / 流血</p>\n<p>朝该目标 Stride。此次移动<strong>不引发</strong>来自该目标的借机攻击。若结束时与目标相邻，可立刻发动一次<strong>剥皮短刃</strong>或<strong>投掷斧</strong>（近战），该次打击 MAP 正常累计。</p>"
        },
