    {
      "_id": "whbEmSpringTrap1",
      "img": "modules/wang-pf2e-homebrew/assets/hunt/bear-trap.png",
      "name": "林间陷阱",
      "sort": 600000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "action"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": 2
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>在 5 尺内空地布置 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBearTrp01]{熊陷阱}（或等效猎索）。察觉 DC <strong>22</strong>（她的 Stealth DC）。</p>\n<p>生物进入该格：腿部被夹，受到 @Damage[2d8[piercing]]，并尝试 @Check[reflex|dc:22]{反射 DC 20}。失败则 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{定身}，直至以 Interact 挣脱（运动 DC 22）或破坏陷阱。</p>\n<p>她喜欢把陷阱布在撤退路线上，再开枪把人赶进去。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 猎人",
