    },
    {
      "_id": "whbEmRedHood0001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
      "name": "宿敌颅骨",
      "sort": 700000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "action"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": 1
        },
        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>亮出狼颅（或宿敌头骨）恐吓 30 尺内一个能看见她的生物：@Check[will|dc:22|traits:emotion,fear,mental,visual]{意志 DC 22}。</p>\n<p>失败：@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQidQVSrGRTuq]{惊惧 1}（1 分钟，每轮结束可再豁免除）。大失败：惊惧 2。成功则本场对她的此能力免疫。</p>\n<p>这是对所有猎手的警告。</p>"
        },
