    {
      "_id": "whbEmBushcraft01",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "红帽猎人",
      "sort": 800000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "passive"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": "defensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>在森林、灌丛、雾沼等自然地形：Stealth 与 Survival 获得 <strong>+2 环境加值</strong>；她为 Hide / Sneak 视自然掩体为可用遮挡（GM 裁定）。</p>\n<p>冰冷的血：对抗恐惧效果时意志豁免 <strong>+1 状态</strong>。她不救「无辜旁观者」——只猎她认定的恶。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 猎人",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
